COMMERCIAL LICENSE OPTION

If you wish to use Linky in a commercial context, you have two options:

1. Open Source License (GPLv3)
   - Use Linky under the GPLv3 license
   - Make your source code available under the same license
   - Provide attribution
   - No fee required

2. Commercial License
   - Use Linky without making your source code public
   - Priority support
   - Custom features and integration support
   - Contact us for pricing and terms

For commercial licensing inquiries, please contact:
Email: your-email@example.com
Website: https://your-website.com

